m:text-2xl"><span class="sm:hidden">Managed Security Services</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">Managed Security Services</span></h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white sm:mt-3 sm:text-base">Security woven into every service with monitoring, detection, and resilience.</p></div></a><a href="/services/managed-it" class="glass-card hover-breathe hover-glow-brand p-4 sm:p-0 transition-all duration-500 flex items-center gap-5 sm:flex-col sm:text-center sm:max-w-72 sm:w-full"><div class="w-20 shrink-0 sm:mx-auto sm:w-auto sm:max-w-60 sm:p-0"><img src="/images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon.webp" srcset="/images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-800w.webp 800w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 80px, 184px" alt="Managed IT Services" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover float" style="animation-delay:4s"></div><div class="min-w-0 sm:mx-auto sm:max-w-3/4 sm:pb-8 sm:-mt-4"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-heading sm:text-2xl"><span class="sm:hidden">Managed IT Services</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">Managed IT Services</span></h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white sm:mt-3 sm:text-base">Reliable IT that supports productivity and keeps your business running.</p></div></a><!--]--></div><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section class="section-padding relative" data-v-2168e633><img src="/images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect.webp" srcset="/images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-800w.webp 800w" sizes="55vw" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="eclipse eclipse--br eclipse--drift absolute z-0 pointer-events-none" style="right:-25%;bottom:-30%;width:55%" aria-hidden="true" data-v-2168e633><div class="mx-auto max-w-nav relative z-2" data-aos="fade-in" data-v-2168e633><h2 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-medium text-heading md:text-4xl text-center mx-auto" data-v-2168e633>Technology should make your business faster, safer, and more efficient</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white text-center" data-v-2168e633>Your advantage comes from systems that:</p><div class="mt-18 grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-v-2168e633><span class="glass-card hover-breathe h-24 flex items-center justify-center px-6 text-center font-semibold text-white" data-v-2168e633>Stay Secure</span><span class="glass-card hover-breathe h-24 flex items-center justify-center px-6 text-center font-semibold text-white" data-v-2168e633>Fix Issues Automatically</span><span class="glass-card hover-breathe h-24 flex items-center justify-center px-6 text-center font-semibold text-white" data-v-2168e633>Reduce Downtime</span><span class="glass-card hover-breathe h-24 flex items-center justify-center px-6 text-center font-semibold text-white" data-v-2168e633>Improve Accuracy</span><span class="glass-card hover-breathe h-24 flex items-center justify-center px-6 text-center font-semibold text-white" data-v-2168e633>Cut Wasted Time and Cost</span></div><div class="mt-24 grid items-start gap-24 md:grid-cols-2" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-delay="100" data-v-2168e633><div class="justify-center items-center flex flex-col h-full" data-v-2168e633><p class="text-2xl leading-snug font-semibold gradient-brand-text md:text-right md:text-3xl" data-v-2168e633>When technology works,<br data-v-2168e633>the business works.</p></div><div class="space-y-4 text-xl leading-relaxed" data-v-2168e633><p data-v-2168e633>Most managed IT service providers take a reactive approach, waiting for issues to disrupt your business before responding.</p><p data-v-2168e633>We build environments that avoid problems entirely and keep your team moving.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding" data-v-2168e633><div class="mx-auto max-w-nav" data-aos="fade-in" data-v-2168e633><div class="text-center" data-v-2168e633><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-heading md:text-4xl" data-v-2168e633>The Three Pillars of Modern IT Excellence</h2><p class="mt-4 text-2xl tracking-wide text-white" data-v-2168e633>This is how your advantage is created</p></div><div class="mt-24 grid items-start gap-12 md:grid-cols-5 max-w-7xl mx-auto" data-v-2168e633><div class="space-y-6 col-span-3" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><div data-v-2168e633><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 py-4 text-left" data-v-2168e633><span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-heading uppercase" data-v-2168e633>AI Consulting and Intelligent Automation</span><svg class="-rotate-90 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" data-v-2168e633=""><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" data-v-2168e633=""/></svg></button><div class="pb-6 pl-0" style="display:none" data-v-2168e633><p class="mb-3 text-lg text-white" data-v-2168e633>Practical automation that:</p><ul class="space-y-1.5" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Reduces Manual Work</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Eliminates Repetitive Tasks</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Improves Accuracy</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Creates Efficiency Without Adding Headcount</li><!--]--></ul></div></div><div data-v-2168e633><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 py-4 text-left" data-v-2168e633><span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-heading uppercase" data-v-2168e633>Managed Security Services</span><svg class="-rotate-90 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" data-v-2168e633=""><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" data-v-2168e633=""/></svg></button><div class="pb-6 pl-0" style="display:none" data-v-2168e633><p class="mb-3 text-lg text-white" data-v-2168e633>Security built into every layer of your technology:</p><ul class="space-y-1.5" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Continuous Protection</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Threat Detection</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Email Security</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> SOC and SIEM Monitoring</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Identity Security</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Ransomware Resilience</li><!--]--></ul></div></div><div data-v-2168e633><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 py-4 text-left" data-v-2168e633><span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-heading uppercase" data-v-2168e633>Managed IT Services</span><svg class="-rotate-90 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" data-v-2168e633=""><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" data-v-2168e633=""/></svg></button><div class="pb-6 pl-0" style="display:none" data-v-2168e633><p class="mb-3 text-lg text-white" data-v-2168e633>Reliable, responsive support that keeps systems running smoothly and staff focused on work instead of troubleshooting.</p><ul class="space-y-1.5" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Proactive Monitoring</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Help Desk Support</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Infrastructure Management</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Cloud Services</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Strategic IT Planning</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white" data-v-2168e633></span> Vendor Management</li><!--]--></ul></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="hidden items-start justify-center md:flex -mt-12 col-span-2" data-v-2168e633><div class="relative w-full" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><img src="/images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon.webp" srcset="/images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon-800w.webp 800w, /images/icons/ai-automation-data-processing-isometric-icon-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 0px, 400px" alt="AI Consulting and Intelligent Automation" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="float-slow transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-100" data-v-2168e633><img src="/images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon.webp" srcset="/images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon-800w.webp 800w, /images/icons/cybersecurity-lock-and-key-isometric-icon-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 0px, 400px" alt="Managed Security Services" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="float-slow transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0 -scale-x-100" data-v-2168e633><img src="/images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon.webp" srcset="/images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-800w.webp 800w, /images/icons/managed-it-services-dashboard-isometric-icon-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 0px, 400px" alt="Managed IT Services" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="float-slow transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0 absolute inset-0" data-v-2168e633><!--]--></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-padding" data-v-2168e633><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl" data-v-2168e633><h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-heading md:text-4xl" data-aos="fade-in" data-v-2168e633>Why Infonaligy Stands Out<br data-v-2168e633>in a Crowded MSP Market</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-2xl leading-relaxed" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-delay="100" data-v-2168e633>Most MSPs compete on price, response times, and who can close the most tickets. <strong class="text-heading" data-v-2168e633>We compete on outcomes.</strong> Our approach combines:</p><ul class="mt-14 space-y-3.5" data-v-2168e633><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-v-2168e633>Security First Strategy</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-v-2168e633>AI Assisted Service Delivery</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400" data-v-2168e633>Automated Resolution for Common Issues</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500" data-v-2168e633>Industry Specific Workflows</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600" data-v-2168e633>Local DFW Support Teams</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="700" data-v-2168e633>Enterprise Grade Tools</li><li class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-brand-text-reverse md:text-2xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="800" data-v-2168e633>Clear Reporting And Visibility</li></ul><p class="mt-14 text-xl" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-delay="950" data-v-2168e633>We don't just fix problems. <strong class="text-heading" data-v-2168e633>We build systems that avoid them.</strong></p></div></section><section class="section-padding" style="background-image:url(/images/banners/darker-overlay-global-network-data-visualization-background.webp);background-position:center;background-size:auto;background-repeat:no-repeat" data-v-2168e633><div class="mx-auto max-w-nav" data-v-2168e633><h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold text-heading md:text-4xl" data-aos="fade-in" data-v-2168e633>Built For Industries Where Downtime Is Expensive</h2><div class="industries-cards mt-14 flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-x-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-v-2168e633><div class="w-full md:w-120 glass-card hover-breathe p-8" data-v-2168e633><p class="text-base text-white" data-v-2168e633>If technology can slow down:</p><ul class="mt-4 pl-4 space-y-2" data-v-2168e633><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Revenue</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Productivity</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Compliance</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Operations</li></ul><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-white" data-v-2168e633>...then you need more<br data-v-2168e633>than basic IT support.</p></div><div class="glass-card hover-breathe p-8" data-v-2168e633><p class="text-sm text-white" data-v-2168e633>We serve organizations that rely on accuracy, uptime, and performance, including:</p><ul class="mt-4 pl-4 space-y-3" data-v-2168e633><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base font-medium text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Architecture, Engineering, and Construction Firms</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base font-medium text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Private Equity Portfolios and Capital Management Groups</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base font-medium text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Car Dealerships and Automotive Groups</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base font-medium text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Manufacturing and Distribution</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base font-medium text-heading" data-v-2168e633><span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white/40" data-v-2168e633></span> Dental, Optometry, and Chiropractic Groups with Multiple Locations</li></ul></div></div><p class="mt-10 text-center text-xl tracking-wide text-white mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-aos="fade-in" data-aos-delay="200" data-v-2168e633>Whether you manage job sites, production lines, multiple offices, or dealership networks, we help everything stay secure and connected.</p></div></section><section class="section-padding !pb-6 md:!pb-24 relative" data-v-2168e633><img src="/images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect.webp" srcset="/images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-240w.webp 240w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-480w.webp 480w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-600w.webp 600w, /images/icons/svg/blue-eclipse-effect-800w.webp 800w" sizes="65vw" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="eclipse eclipse--tl eclipse--drift absolute z-0 pointer-events-none" style="left:-10%;top:-30%;width:65%" aria-hidden="true" data-v-2168e633><div class="mx-auto max-w-nav relative z-2" data-v-2168e633><div class="text-center" data-aos="fade-in" data-v-2168e633><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-heading md:text-3xl" data-v-2168e633>How Intelligent Automation Helps You Grow</h2><p class="mt-4 text-2xl text-white" data-v-2168e633>Automation now handles:</p></div><div class="mt-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto sm:mt-18" data-v-2168e633><div class="space-y-2 sm:hidden" data-v-2168e633><!--[--><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2" data-v-2168e633><img src="/images/icons/svg/new-user-onboarding-icon.svg" alt="New User
